meta {
  name: 44-devices-auth-requests
  seq: 44
}

docs {
  Devices, login with another device (auth requests), the passkeys an account
  logs in with, and the breach lookup.

  Saving a passkey or trusting a device needs real WebAuthn and key material,
  so those requests only record the route. The device each account logged in
  with in `00-setup` is `contract-<token name>`, for example
  `contract-ownerToken`.
}
